cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If this analysis helps your work, cite this repository and the source datasets listed in REFERENCES.md."
type: software
title: "Lung injury and repair states from public single-cell RNA-seq"
authors:
  - family-names: "Xorca"
repository-code: "https://github.com/xorca0711/scRNA_seq"
url: "https://github.com/xorca0711/scRNA_seq"
abstract: >-
  An analysis log of public lung single-cell RNA-seq reanalysis, built from the
  deposited count matrices with the authors' annotations held out, toward the
  question of which epithelial and immune-state programmes distinguish
  productive lung repair from persistent remodelling after injury.
keywords:
  - single-cell RNA-seq
  - scanpy
  - lung repair
  - macrophage and monocyte states
  - lineage tracing
date-released: 2026-09-10
